    "Find mods on Nexus Mods and install them": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trouver des mods sur Nexus Mods et les installer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find mods on Nexus Mods, or drop .pak files and archives (.zip, .7z, .rar) on this window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trouvez des mods sur Nexus Mods, ou déposez des fichiers .pak et des archives (.zip, .7z, .rar) sur cette fenêtre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dossier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forward": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suivant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free accounts download through the Nexus website. Sign in once in Tadpole's Nexus browser (the sign-in is remembered), then click **Mod Manager Download** and **Slow download**: the mod installs automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les comptes gratuits téléchargent via le site de Nexus. Connectez-vous une fois dans le navigateur Nexus de Tadpole (la connexion est mémorisée), puis cliquez sur **Mod Manager Download** et **Slow download** : le mod s’installe tout seul."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Game": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide key": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Masquer la clé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install .pak files or archives (or drop them on the window)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installer des fichiers .pak ou des archives (ou les déposer sur la fenêtre)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Mods": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installer des mods"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Mods…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installer des mods…"
          }
        }
      }
