      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lancer Baldur’s Gate 3 via Steam"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listed, but its .pak isn't in the Mods folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Listé, mais son .pak n’est pas dans le dossier Mods"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Load Order": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ordre de chargement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loaded": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loads after this mod: use Order by Requirements": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargé après ce mod : utilisez Trier selon les prérequis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mods": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mods"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mods load from top to bottom; drag to reorder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les mods se chargent de haut en bas ; faites-les glisser pour changer l’ordre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move each mod's requirements before it, keeping the rest of the order": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Placer les prérequis de chaque mod avant lui, sans changer le reste de l’ordre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move to Trash": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Placer dans la corbeille"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move to Trash…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Placer dans la corbeille…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needed to download mods. Sign in to Nexus, open your account's API Keys page, and copy the “Personal API Key” at the bottom. It's stored in your Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nécessaire pour télécharger des mods. Connectez-vous à Nexus, ouvrez la page « API Keys » de votre compte et copiez la « Personal API Key » tout en bas. Elle est conservée dans votre trousseau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nexus API Key Needed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clé d’API Nexus nécessaire"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nexus didn't return a download link for this file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nexus n’a renvoyé aucun lien de téléchargement pour ce fichier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nexus mod %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mod Nexus %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nexus Mods": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nexus Mods"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nexus Mods API Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clé d’API Nexus Mods"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nexus only allows direct downloads for Premium members. Use “Mod Manager Download” on the website instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nexus ne permet le téléchargement direct qu’aux membres Premium. Utilisez plutôt « Mod Manager Download » sur le site."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nexus rate limit reached. Try again in a little while.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Limite de requêtes Nexus atteinte. Réessayez dans un moment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nexus request failed (HTTP %lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La requête à Nexus a échoué (HTTP %lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No .pak file in this download. Mods made of loose files or for the Script Extender can't be installed by Tadpole.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun fichier .pak dans ce téléchargement. Tadpole ne peut pas installer les mods faits de fichiers libres ni ceux pour le Script Extender."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No .pak file was found in: %@. Mods made of loose files or for the Script Extender can't be installed this way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun fichier .pak trouvé dans : %@. Les mods faits de fichiers séparés ou pour le Script Extender ne peuvent pas être installés ainsi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No mod description inside: the game always loads these. Move one to the Trash to stop it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans description de mod : le jeu les charge toujours. Placez-en un dans la corbeille pour l’arrêter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No mod description inside: the game always loads this file. Move it to the Trash to stop it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans description de mod : le jeu charge toujours ce fichier. Placez-le dans la corbeille pour l’arrêter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
